{"context":"Cross-project butuh knowledge bersih bukan full stratum. Object harus immutable, tanpa runtime dependency, versioned per release, seragam EKA/non-EKA, executable-like (list/scan/fetch mandiri), isi L0-L2.","decision":"Sharing object = CKO baru token shr, snapshot copy + pin hash saat rilis, derives-from rel: versi, tanpa depends-on live. Akses CLI+MCP dulu (get/view/export/import + MCP list/search/fetch). Title/description wajib. Opt-in default share nothing.","consequences":"Positif: bundle mandiri, fetch tanpa repo sumber, versioning jelas, skema seragam, patuh ADR-006/011. Negatif: token shr baru = ubah standard; field level+provenance baru; builder audit non-EKA non-deterministik wajib provenance.","alternativesConsidered":"Proyeksi atas CKO ada (murah, tapi bocor stratum, filter rapuh) — ditolak. Daemon query live (enak, tapi ops/auth/lifecycle besar, determinism pecah) — ditunda sebagai proyeksi tipis pasca kontrak stabil."}